data: {"id": "16d8c9a40df64e3c-thinking-parallel_evidence-173", "run_id": "16d8c9a40df64e3c", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "先总结已有基线事实，再执行计划的 Kubernetes 采集。\n\n**已有基线（ReAct 启动前并行采集）**\n- Metrics (Prometheus): `kube_pod_container_status_waiting_reason=1 (reason=\"ContainerCreating\")`, `kube_pod_status_phase=Pending(1)`, restarts=0 → 确认 Pod 仍在 Pending/ContainerCreating 阶段，未启动。\n- Logging (ES): empty → 容器未运行，无日志。\n- Tracing (DeepFlow/Tempo): empty, pod_ip=null → Pod 未分配 IP，无可查流量。\n\n接下来执行计划的 Kubernetes 采集，以获取 Pod YAML（含 Events）和 Failed 事件。\n\n", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 1, "ts_ms": 1788772689872, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

