data: {"id": "16d8c9a40df64e3c-thinking-parallel_evidence-741", "run_id": "16d8c9a40df64e3c", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "## 已采集事实\n\n| 维度 | 结果 | 与候选原因的关系 |\n|------|------|-----------------|\n| Pod YAML (spec/conditions) | `phase=Pending`, `containerStatus.app.reason=ContainerCreating`, `imagePullSecrets=<absent>`, volume `input` 引用 `configMap/unavailable-config` | 直接暴露了两个关键依赖：ConfigMap 不存在、无 imagePullSecrets |\n| K8s Events | `FailedMount: configmap \"unavailable-config\" not found` (4m20s, x40 over 69m)；`timed out waiting for the condition` (8m24s, x27 over 67m) | **确证**：Pod 停滞于 ContainerCreating 的直接原因是 Volume 挂载失败，因为 ", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 2, "ts_ms": 1788772698254, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

